## What was built
A native WinUI 3 NavigationView shell + typed route registry porting **156 routes** from `web/src/App.tsx` (6 standalone, 8 redirects, 10 parameterized, 1 catch-all, 120 nav-visible across 19 groups).

**Core (net10.0, testable):** `RouteGroup`, `RouteDefinition`, `RouteTable` (full App.tsx port incl. aliases/redirects/`:id` params/`s/:token`/standalone/catch-all), `RouteRegistry` (match ΓåÆ param-extract ΓåÆ redirect-resolve ΓåÆ deep-link), `DeepLink` (`teslasync://`), `NavigationHistory` (back/forward), `RecentPages`, `ScrollRestoration` ΓÇö **71 new tests, 494 total passing**.

**App (WinUI):** `ShellWindow` (NavigationView + custom title bar via `AppWindow`/`ExtendsContentIntoTitleBar` + Mica + persisted size/position/theme, breadcrumbs, Alt+ΓåÉ/ΓåÆ accelerators, `TsRouteAnnouncer`), `ShellViewModel`, `ShellPageFactory`, `RoutePendingView` (honest routing-diagnostics host for W7-pending pages ΓÇö not a fake page), `WindowStateService`, `Localization`. Wired `App.xaml.cs` to launch the shell + forward protocol activation; removed `MainWindow`.

